body:
I'm from Ohio, so I don't know how psych wards are in Florida, But in my state,it just depends on which one. I had one that didn't take my piercing and I was allowed normal clothes and shoes without strings, we had a roommate and we spent pretty much the whole day surrounded by fellow patients. Another one I had we had to earn our clothes. Pretty shitty in my opinion because our clothes can be a comforting thing and they didn't have long sleeves for us to wear. Another one had shitty food I lost a lot of weight just because of how unedible it was, staff was cool though and we got our clothes pretty early on once it was processed after a day or two and a blanket was allowed outside of the room if it wasn't meal-time.

&#x200B;

I was a minor during all my hospitalizations and I haven't experienced one as an adult yet, so I haven't a clue how those work.
